 are you from?\nZoe(girl): I'm from the U.S.","lines":["I'm from the {}."],"ans":["U.S."],"hint":["미국을 말하는 나라 이름을 써요."]}},{"lesson":6,"pos":3,"n":2,"kind":"lblank","tag":"listen","payload":{"tag":"listen","inst":"잘 듣고, 이름의 철자를 써 봅니다.","k":"lblank","say":"Teacher(woman): How do you spell your name?\nAmy(girl): A-M-Y.","lines":["{}."],"ans":["A-M-Y"],"hint":["알파벳을 하나씩 - 로 이어서 써요."]}},{"lesson":6,"pos":3,"n":3,"kind":"lblank","tag":"listen","payload":{"tag":"listen","inst":"잘 듣고, 이름의 철자를 써 봅니다.","k":"lblank","say":"Teacher(man): How do you spell your name?\nEmily(girl): E-M-I-L-Y.","lines":["{}."],"ans":["E-M-I-L-Y"],"hint":["알파벳을 하나씩 - 로 이어서 써요."]}},{"lesson":6,"pos":4,"n":0,"kind":"looktalk","tag":"speak","payload":{"tag":"speak","pic":"korea","k":"looktalk","label":"Hana","turns":[{"target":"Where are you from?"},{"target":"I'm from Korea."}],"hint":["Where are you from? / I'm from ~."]}},{"lesson":6,"pos":4,"n":1,"kind":"looktalk","tag":"speak","payload":{"tag":"speak","pic":"france","k":"looktalk","label":"Chloe","turns":[{"target":"Where are you from?"},{"target":"I'm from France."}],"hint":["Where are you from? / I'm from ~."]}},{"lesson":6,"pos":4,"n":2,"kind":"looktalk","tag":"speak","payload":{"tag":"speak","pic":"egypt","k":"looktalk","label":"Amir","turns":[{"target":"Where are you from?"},{"target":"I'm from Egypt."}],"hint":["Where are you from? / I'm from ~."]}},{"lesson":6,"pos":4,"n":3,"kind":"looktalk","tag":"speak","payload":{"tag":"speak","pic":"us","k":"looktalk","label":"Tom","turns":[{"target":"Where are you from?"},{"target":"I'm from the U.S."}],"hint":["Where are you from? / I'm from ~."]}},{"lesson":6,"pos":5,"n":0,"kind":"sscram","tag":"write","payload":{"tag":"write","k":"sscram","ans":"Where are you from?","extra":["is"]}},{"lesson":6,"pos":5,"n":1,"kind":"sscram","tag":"write","payload":{"tag":"write","k":"sscram","ans":"I'm from Korea.","extra":["in"]}},{"lesson":6,"pos":5,"n":2,"kind":"sscram","tag":"write","payload":{"tag":"write","k":"sscram","ans":"How do you spell your name?","extra":["say"]}},{"lesson":6,"pos":5,"n":3,"kind":"sscram","tag":"write","payload":{"tag":"write","k":"sscram","ans":"I'm from Brazil.","extra":["at"]}},{"lesson":6,"pos":5,"n":4,"kind":"sscram","tag":"write","payload":{"tag":"write","k":"sscram","ans":"Nice to meet you.","extra":["see"]}},{"lesson":6,"pos":5,"n":5,"kind":"sscram","tag":"write","payload":{"tag":"write","k":"sscram","ans":"I'm from the U.S.","extra":["a"]}},{"lesson":6,"pos":6,"n":0,"kind":"dfillt","tag":"write","payload":{"tag":"write","k":"dfillt","cue":"프랑스 • Chloe","lines":["A: {} are you from?","B: {} from France."],"ans":["Where","I'm|I am"]}},{"lesson":6,"pos":6,"n":1,"kind":"dfillt","tag":"write","payload":{"tag":"write","k":"dfillt","cue":"한국 • Hana","lines":["A: Where are you {}?","B: I'm {} Korea."],"ans":["from","from"]}},{"lesson":6,"pos":6,"n":2,"kind":"dfillt","tag":"write","payload":{"tag":"write","k":"dfillt","cue":"태국 • Kai","lines":["A: Where {} you from?","B: I'm from {}."],"ans":["are","Thailand"]}},{"lesson":6,"pos":6,"n":3,"kind":"dfillt","tag":"write","payload":{"tag":"write","k":"dfillt","cue":"이름 철자 • Leo","lines":["A: How do you {} your name?","B: {}."],"ans":["spell","L-E-O"]}},{"lesson":6,"pos":7,"n":0,"kind":"sqset","tag":"read","payload":{"tag":"read","pic":"brazil","k":"sqset","title":"Pen Pal","text":["Hello! My name is Mia.","I'm from the U.S.","I like pizza.","---","My pen pal is Lucas.","He's from Brazil.","He likes soccer."],"ko":"안녕! 내 이름은 미아야.\n나는 미국에서 왔어.\n나는 피자를 좋아해.\n---\n내 펜팔 친구는 루카스야.\n루카스는 브라질에서 왔어.\n루카스는 축구를 좋아해.","explain":["[[I'm from the U.S.]]에서 미아가 어느 나라에서 왔는지 알 수 있어요.","[[pen pal]]은 편지나 메시지를 주고받는 친구예요."],"qs":[{"t":"mc","q":"미아는 어느 나라에서 왔나요?","ans":"미국","wrong":["브라질","한국"],"hint":"두 번째 문장을 읽어 보세요.","ev":"2"},{"t":"mc","q":"루카스가 좋아하는 것은 무엇인가요?","ans":"축구","wrong":["피자","음악"],"hint":"likes 가 나오는 문장을 찾아 보세요.","ev":"7"}]}},{"lesson":6,"pos":7,"n":1,"kind":"sqset","tag":"read","payload":{"tag":"read","pic":"thailand","k":"sqset","title":"Who Am I?","text":["I'm from Thailand.","I like animals.","I can ride an elephant.","Who am I?","---","My name is Kai.","K-A-I."],"ko":"나는 태국에서 왔어.\n나는 동물을 좋아해.\n나는 코끼리를 탈 수 있어.\n나는 누구일까?\n---\n내 이름은 카이야.\nK-A-I.","explain":["[[I'm from Thailand.]]에서 나라를 알 수 있어요.","[[I can …]]은 \"나는 …을 할 수 있어\"라는 뜻이에요."],"qs":[{"t":"mc","q":"카이는 어느 나라에서 왔나요?","ans":"태국","wrong":["이집트","프랑스"],"hint":"첫 번째 문장을 읽어 보세요.","ev":"1"},{"t":"tf","hint":"나라와 이름 철자를 확인해 보세요.","ev":"1,2,7","lines":["Kai likes animals. | T","Kai is from Korea. | F","Kai's name is K-A-I. | T"]}]}},{"lesson":6,"pos":8,"n":0,"kind":"lmatch","tag":"listen","payload":{"tag":"listen","k":"lmatch","pairs":[{"left":"Hana","say":"Where are you from? I'm from Korea.","right":"korea"},{"left":"Leo","say":"Where are you from? I'm from Brazil.","right":"brazil"},{"left":"Chloe","say":"Where are you from? I'm from France.","right":"france"},{"left":"Amir","say":"Where are you from? I'm from Egypt.","right":"egypt"},{"left":"Kai","say":"Where are you from? I'm from Thailand.","right":"thailand"},{"left":"Tom","say":"Where are you from? I'm from the U.S.","right":"us"}]}},{"lesson":6,"pos":12,"n":0,"kind":"sbuild","tag":"write","payload":{"tag":"write","k":"sbuild","ko":"너는 어느 나라에서 왔니?","ans":"Where are you from?","starter":"Where"}},{"lesson":6,"pos":12,"n":1,"kind":"sbuild","tag":"write","payload":{"tag":"write","k":"sbuild","ko":"나는 한국에서 왔어.","ans":"I'm from Korea.","alts":["I am from Korea."],"starter":"I'm"}},{"lesson":6,"pos":12,"n":2,"kind":"sbuild","tag":"write","payload":{"tag":"write","k":"sbuild","ko":"너의 이름은 철자가 어떻게 되니?","ans":"How do you spell your name?","starter":"How"}},{"lesson":6,"pos":12,"n":3,"kind":"sbuild","tag":"write","payload":{"tag":"write","k":"sbuild","ko":"나는 미국에서 왔어.","ans":"I'm from the U.S.","alts":["I am from the U.S."],"starter":"I'm"}},{"lesson":6,"pos":13,"n":0,"kind":"lnum","tag":"listen","payload":{"tag":"listen","inst":"들려주는 말에 이어질 말을 골라요.","k":"lnum","q":"Where are you from?","opts":["I'm Leo.","I'm from Brazil.","L-E-O."],"ans":2,"plays":2}},{"lesson":6,"pos":13,"n":1,"kind":"lnum","tag":"listen","payload":{"tag":"listen","inst":"들려주는 말에 이어질 말을 골라요.","k":"lnum","q":"How do you spell your name?","opts":["H-A-N-A.","I'm from Korea.","Nice to meet you."],"ans":1,"plays":2}},{"lesson":6,"pos":13,"n":2,"kind":"lnum","tag":"listen","payload":{"tag":"listen","inst":"들려주는 말에 이어질 말을 골라요.","k":"lnum","q":"Hi, I'm Kai. Nice to meet you.","opts":["I'm from Thailand.","Nice to meet you, too.","K-A-I."],"ans":2,"plays":2}}]$j$::jsonb) as x(lesson int, pos int, n int, kind text, tag text, payload jsonb);
  select count(*) into v_miss from _l1 d where not exists (select 1 from flow_steps s join flow_lessons fl on fl.id = s.lesson_id where fl.unit_id = v_unit and fl.no = d.lesson and s.pos = d.pos and s.kind = d.kind);
  if v_miss > 0 then raise exception 'L1 content: % item(s) do not match a flow step (lesson/pos/kind): %', v_miss, (select string_agg(distinct d.lesson || '-' || d.pos || ' ' || d.kind, ', ') from _l1 d where not exists (select 1 from flow_steps s join flow_lessons fl on fl.id = s.lesson_id where fl.unit_id = v_unit and fl.no = d.lesson and s.pos = d.pos and s.kind = d.kind)); end if;
  insert into items(unit_id, lesson, act_idx, level, template, tag, payload, status, step_id, created_at)
  select v_unit, d.lesson, d.pos, 'CORE', d.kind, d.tag, d.payload, 'draft', s.id, now() + (d.n * interval '1 millisecond')
    from _l1 d join flow_lessons fl on fl.unit_id = v_unit and fl.no = d.lesson join flow_steps s on s.lesson_id = fl.id and s.pos = d.pos;
  get diagnostics v_n = row_count;
  if v_n <> (select count(*) from _l1) then raise exception 'L1 content: inserted % of %', v_n, (select count(*) from _l1); end if;
  raise notice 'L1 items: % (draft)', v_n;
  raise notice 'L1 flow steps without items: %', (select coalesce(string_agg(fl.no || '-' || s.pos || ' ' || s.kind, ', '), '(none)') from flow_steps s join flow_lessons fl on fl.id = s.lesson_id where fl.unit_id = v_unit and not exists (select 1 from items i where i.step_id = s.id));

  -- 교과서 QR 음원·영상 스크립트
  delete from unit_sources where unit_id = v_unit and kind = 'script';
  insert into unit_sources(unit_id, kind, lesson_no, sort, title, body, memo, remark)
  select v_unit, 'script', x.lesson_no, x.sort, x.title, x.body, x.memo, x.remark from jsonb_to_recordset($j$[{"lesson_no":1,"sort":1,"title":"음원1","body":"Where are you from?\nI'm from Thailand","memo":"단원의 주제를 소개하기 위한 영상\n(1차시의 학습목표가 '말을 듣고 이해하기'로 규정)","remark":""},{"lesson_no":1,"sort":2,"title":"음원2","body":"Where are you from?\nI'm from Brazil\nI'm Pablo.\nHow do you spell your name?\nP-A-B-L-O","memo":"","remark":""},{"lesson_no":1,"sort":3,"title":"영상 (1/2)","body":"Welcome to Paris.\nLet's say hello to our new friends.\nHello\nMy name is Minseo.\nNice to meet you.\nHi, I'm Oliver.\nNice to meet you.\nWhere are you from?\nI'm from Korea.\nWhere are you from?\nI'm from the U.S.\nThis is Minseo.\nShe's from Korea.\nHi, I'm Ebonee.\nI'm from Egypt.\nHello. Ebonee.\nI like your name.\nHow do you spell your name?\nE-B-O-N-E-E.\nIt's a beautiful name.\n3, 2, 1!","memo":"","remark":"유사하게 변경 필요"},{"lesson_no":1,"sort":4,"title":"영상 (2/2)","body":"Good morning.\nWe have a new friend today.\nNice to meet you all.\nHi, Minseo.","memo":"","remark":"유사하게 변경 필요"},{"lesson_no":2,"sort":5,"title":"영상 1","body":"Hello.\nNice to meet you\nNice to meet you, too.\nWhat's your name?\nMy name is Siya.\nHow do you spell your name?\nS-I-Y-A.","memo":"","remark":"유사하게 변경 필요"},{"lesson_no":2,"sort":6,"title":"영상2","body":"Hi, Jian.\nHi, Minseo.\nThis is my new friend, Siya.\nHi, I'm Minseo.\nWhere are you from?\nI'm from Thailand.\nNice to meet you, Siya.\nCome here.\nLet's play badminton together.","memo":"","remark":"유사하게 변경 필요"},{"lesson_no":2,"sort":7,"title":"영상3","body":"","memo":"Speak more 영상 (교재에 있음)","remark":""},{"lesson_no":5,"sort":8,"title":"음원","body":"Hello.\nWe are group one.\nLook at these pictures.\nThey are our heroes.\nMy name is Emily.\nI'm from Canada.\nI like donuts.\nI am strong.\nI can fly in the sky.\nThank you very much.","memo":"Watch and think의 샘플영상","remark":"유사하게 변경 필요"},{"lesson_no":6,"sort":9,"title":"1번 음원","body":"<no. 1>\nA : Where are you from?\nB : I'm from France.\n<no. 2>\nA : Where are you from?\nB : I'm from Brazil","memo":"","remark":""},{"lesson_no":6,"sort":10,"title":"2번 음원","body":"<no. 1>\nA : Where are you from?\nB : I'm from Thailand.\n<no. 2>\nA : Where are you from?\nB : I'm from Korea.\nA : How do you spell your name?\nB : M-I-N-J-I","memo":"","remark":""},{"lesson_no":6,"sort":11,"title":"3번 음원","body":"<no. 1>\nA : Where are you from?\nB : I'm from Egypt.\n<no. 2>\nA : Where are you from?\nB : I'm from the U.S.\nA : How do you spell your name?\nB : A-M-Y","memo":"","remark":""},{"lesson_no":6,"sort":12,"title":"4번 음원","body":"<no. 1>\nA : Where are you from?\nB : I'm from France.\nA : Where are you from?\nB : I'm from Korea.\n<no. 2>\nA : How do you spell your name?\nB : E-M-I-L-Y","memo":"","remark":""}]$j$::jsonb) as x(lesson_no int, sort int, title text, body text, memo text, remark text);

  -- 장면 이미지 프롬프트: 스타일 세트(L9 화풍 복사) + 이 Lesson 인물 + 장면별 프롬프트
  insert into art_styles(name, style, avoid, chars)
  select '비상 초5 영어 L1', a.style, 'text, letters, words, numbers, watermark, logo, manga style, anime style, chibi, realistic photo, 3D render, scary, dark, extra fingers, distorted faces, brand names', $j$[{"name":"Ms. Green","desc":"Cartoon woman camp leader in her 30s, light-skinned, short auburn hair, green polo shirt with a whistle on a cord, warm welcoming smile"},{"name":"Hana","desc":"Cartoon girl about 11 years old, light-skinned, long straight black hair in a ponytail, yellow hoodie, bright cheerful smile"},{"name":"Leo","desc":"Cartoon boy about 11 years old, tan skin, short curly dark hair, green and yellow soccer jersey, friendly grin"},{"name":"Chloe","desc":"Cartoon girl about 11 years old, light-skinned, wavy blonde hair under a navy beret, navy striped shirt, gentle smile"},{"name":"Tom","desc":"Cartoon boy about 11 years old, light-skinned, short sandy-brown hair with freckles, red baseball cap, blue hoodie"},{"name":"Mr. Brown","desc":"Cartoon man teacher in his 40s, dark-brown skin, short black hair and glasses, gray cardigan over a white shirt, kind smile"},{"name":"Amir","desc":"Cartoon boy about 11 years old, medium-brown skin, short black hair, light blue t-shirt, school backpack, shy but happy smile"},{"name":"Ms. Park","desc":"Cartoon librarian woman in her 30s, light-skinned, black bob haircut, round glasses, mint cardigan, blank name badge on a lanyard"},{"name":"Kai","desc":"Cartoon boy about 11 years old, tan skin, straight black hair, orange t-shirt, curious smile"},{"name":"Yuna","desc":"Cartoon girl about 11 years old, light-skinned, short black bob with a red hairpin, white t-shirt and denim overalls, energetic smile"},{"name":"Zoe","desc":"Cartoon girl about 11 years old, dark-brown skin, curly hair in two puffs, purple jacket, cheerful expression"},{"name":"Lucas","desc":"Cartoon boy about 11 years old, tan skin, short wavy dark-brown hair, blue t-shirt, holding a soccer ball, happy grin"}]$j$::jsonb
    from art_styles a where a.name = '비상 초5 영어 L9'
  on conflict (name) do update set chars = excluded.chars, avoid = excluded.avoid
  returning id into v_style;
  if v_style is null then raise notice 'L9 art style not found - L1 scene prompts skipped'; else
    insert into lesson_chars(unit_id, chars, updated_at) values (v_unit, $j$[{"name":"Ms. Green","desc":"Cartoon woman camp leader in her 30s, light-skinned, short auburn hair, green polo shirt with a whistle on a cord, warm welcoming smile"},{"name":"Hana","desc":"Cartoon girl about 11 years old, light-skinned, long straight black hair in a ponytail, yellow hoodie, bright cheerful smile"},{"name":"Leo","desc":"Cartoon boy about 11 years old, tan skin, short curly dark hair, green and yellow soccer jersey, friendly grin"},{"name":"Chloe","desc":"Cartoon girl about 11 years old, light-skinned, wavy blonde hair under a navy beret, navy striped shirt, gentle smile"},{"name":"Tom","desc":"Cartoon boy about 11 years old, light-skinned, short sandy-brown hair with freckles, red baseball cap, blue hoodie"},{"name":"Mr. Brown","desc":"Cartoon man teacher in his 40s, dark-brown skin, short black hair and glasses, gray cardigan over a white shirt, kind smile"},{"name":"Amir","desc":"Cartoon boy about 11 years old, medium-brown skin, short black hair, light blue t-shirt, school backpack, shy but happy smile"},{"name":"Ms. Park","desc":"Cartoon librarian woman in her 30s, light-skinned, black bob haircut, round glasses, mint cardigan, blank name badge on a lanyard"},{"name":"Kai","desc":"Cartoon boy about 11 years old, tan skin, straight black hair, orange t-shirt, curious smile"},{"name":"Yuna","desc":"Cartoon girl about 11 years old, light-skinned, short black bob with a red hairpin, white t-shirt and denim overalls, energetic smile"},{"name":"Zoe","desc":"Cartoon girl about 11 years old, dark-brown skin, curly hair in two puffs, purple jacket, cheerful expression"},{"name":"Lucas","desc":"Cartoon boy about 11 years old, tan skin, short wavy dark-brown hair, blue t-shirt, holding a soccer ball, happy grin"}]$j$::jsonb, now()) on conflict (unit_id) do update set chars = excluded.chars, updated_at = now();
    insert into scene_prompts(unit_id, step_id, seq, lines, desc_ko, prompt, file_name, style_id)
    select v_unit, s.id, x.seq, x.lines, x.desc_ko, x.prompt, x.file_name, v_style
      from jsonb_to_recordset($j$[{"lesson":1,"pos":7,"seq":1,"lines":"1-2","desc_ko":"캠프 입구에서 그린 선생님이 두 팔을 벌려 아이들을 환영하는 장면","prompt":"Ms. Green opens her arms to welcome a group of smiling children (Hana, Leo, Chloe and Tom) with small backpacks, in front of an outdoor summer camp field with colorful tents, green trees and a decorated welcome gate with no text. No text, no letters, no numbers anywhere in the picture.","file_name":"l1-1-7-1"},{"lesson":1,"pos":7,"seq":2,"lines":"3-4","desc_ko":"하나가 손을 흔들며 자기소개를 하고, 친구들이 웃으며 듣는 장면","prompt":"Hana waves hello and smiles while introducing herself, the other children listen happily, an outdoor summer camp field with colorful tents, green trees and a decorated welcome gate with no text. No text, no letters, no numbers anywhere in the picture.","file_name":"l1-1-7-2"},{"lesson":1,"pos":7,"seq":3,"lines":"5-6","desc_ko":"레오가 손을 흔들며 인사하고 하나와 웃으며 악수하는 장면","prompt":"Leo waves and smiles, then shakes hands with Hana, an outdoor summer camp field with colorful tents, green trees and a decorated welcome gate with no text. No text, no letters, no numbers anywhere in the picture.","file_name":"l1-1-7-3"},{"lesson":1,"pos":7,"seq":4,"lines":"7-8","desc_ko":"하나가 궁금한 얼굴로 묻고, 레오가 자랑스럽게 지구본을 들고 대답하는 장면","prompt":"Hana asks Leo with a curious face, Leo proudly holds a small plain globe with no text, an outdoor summer camp field with colorful tents, green trees and a decorated welcome gate with no text. No text, no letters, no numbers anywhere in the picture.","file_name":"l1-1-7-4"},{"lesson":1,"pos":7,"seq":5,"lines":"9-10","desc_ko":"레오가 클로이에게 묻고, 클로이가 작은 파랑·하양·빨강 깃발을 들고 웃으며 대답하는 장면","prompt":"Leo turns to Chloe with a question, Chloe smiles and holds a small flag with blue, white and red vertical stripes, an outdoor summer camp field with colorful tents, green trees and a decorated welcome gate with no text. No text, no letters, no numbers anywhere in the picture.","file_name":"l1-1-7-5"},{"lesson":1,"pos":7,"seq":6,"lines":"11-12","desc_ko":"톰이 모자를 흔들며 인사하고, 그린 선생님과 아이들이 박수 치며 환영하는 장면","prompt":"Tom waves his red cap and smiles, Ms. Green and the children clap happily to welcome everyone, an outdoor summer camp field with colorful tents, green trees and a decorated welcome gate with no text. No text, no letters, no numbers anywhere in the picture.","file_name":"l1-1-7-6"},{"lesson":1,"pos":8,"seq":1,"lines":"1-2","desc_ko":"브라운 선생님이 아침 인사를 하고 새 친구가 왔다고 알리는 장면","prompt":"Mr. Brown stands at the front of a bright elementary school classroom with desks, a clean blackboard with no writing, and a world map on the wall with no text, greets the class with a smile and gestures toward the classroom door, Hana and Leo sit at their desks. No text, no letters, no numbers anywhere in the picture.","file_name":"l1-1-8-1"},{"lesson":1,"pos":8,"seq":2,"lines":"3-4","desc_ko":"아미르가 교실 앞에서 쑥스럽지만 웃으며 인사하는 장면","prompt":"Amir stands at the front of a bright elementary school classroom with desks, a clean blackboard with no writing, and a world map on the wall with no text, waves shyly with a happy smile, Mr. Brown stands beside him. No text, no letters, no numbers anywhere in the picture.","file_name":"l1-1-8-2"},{"lesson":1,"pos":8,"seq":3,"lines":"5-7","desc_ko":"하나가 아미르에게 묻고, 아미르가 대답하고, 레오가 엄지를 세우며 놀라워하는 장면","prompt":"Hana turns to Amir with a friendly question, Amir answers with a proud smile, Leo gives a thumbs up, a bright elementary school classroom with desks, a clean blackboard with no writing, and a world map on the wall with no text. No text, no letters, no numbers anywhere in the picture.","file_name":"l1-1-8-3"},{"lesson":1,"pos":8,"seq":4,"lines":"8-9","desc_ko":"브라운 선생님이 묻고, 아미르가 칠판 앞에서 손가락으로 글자 쓰는 시늉을 하며 대답하는 장면","prompt":"Mr. Brown asks Amir kindly, Amir answers while writing in the air with his finger, a bright elementary school classroom with desks, a clean blackboard with no writing, and a world map on the wall with no text. No text, no letters, no numbers anywhere in the picture.","file_name":"l1-1-8-4"},{"lesson":1,"pos":8,"seq":5,"lines":"10","desc_ko":"선생님과 반 친구들이 박수 치며 아미르를 환영하는 장면","prompt":"Mr. Brown and the class clap and welcome Amir with big smiles, a bright elementary school classroom with desks, a clean blackboard with no writing, and a world map on the wall with no text. No text, no letters, no numbers anywhere in the picture.","file_name":"l1-1-8-5"},{"lesson":2,"pos":3,"seq":1,"lines":"1-2","desc_ko":"사서 선생님이 카운터에서 웃으며 인사하고, 카이도 웃으며 인사하는 장면","prompt":"Ms. Park the librarian smiles and greets Kai at the front desk, Kai smiles back, a cozy school library with tall bookshelves and a wooden front desk. No text, no letters, no numbers anywhere in the picture.","file_name":"l1-2-3-1"},{"lesson":2,"pos":3,"seq":2,"lines":"3-4","desc_ko":"사서 선생님이 이름을 묻고, 카이가 대답하는 장면","prompt":"Ms. Park asks Kai a question with a gentle smile, Kai answers happily while holding a blank library card, a cozy school library with tall bookshelves and a wooden front desk. No text, no letters, no numbers anywhere in the picture.","file_name":"l1-2-3-2"},{"lesson":2,"pos":3,"seq":3,"lines":"5-6","desc_ko":"사서 선생님이 종이를 내밀며 이름 철자를 묻고, 카이가 손가락으로 하나씩 세며 대답하는 장면","prompt":"Ms. Park holds out a blank paper and a pencil, Kai counts letters on his fingers while answering, a cozy school library with tall bookshelves and a wooden front desk. No text, no letters, no numbers anywhere in the picture.","file_name":"l1-2-3-3"},{"lesson":2,"pos":3,"seq":4,"lines":"7-9","desc_ko":"카이가 도서관 카드를 받고, 사서 선생님이 두 팔을 벌려 환영하는 장면","prompt":"Kai happily receives a blank library card, Ms. Park opens her arms to welcome him, books and bookshelves behind, a cozy school library with tall bookshelves and a wooden front desk. No text, no letters, no numbers anywhere in the picture.","file_name":"l1-2-3-4"},{"lesson":2,"pos":4,"seq":1,"lines":"1-2","desc_ko":"유나가 조이에게 손을 흔들며 새 친구를 데려오는 장면","prompt":"Yuna waves to Zoe and brings Lucas, who holds a soccer ball, a sunny city park with green grass, trees and a soccer field. No text, no letters, no numbers anywhere in the picture.","file_name":"l1-2-4-1"},{"lesson":2,"pos":4,"seq":2,"lines":"3-5","desc_ko":"루카스가 인사하고, 조이가 궁금한 얼굴로 묻고, 루카스가 웃으며 대답하는 장면","prompt":"Lucas greets Zoe, Zoe asks him with a curious face, Lucas answers with a big smile, a sunny city park with green grass, trees and a soccer field. No text, no letters, no numbers anywhere in the picture.","file_name":"l1-2-4-2"},{"lesson":2,"pos":4,"seq":3,"lines":"6-8","desc_ko":"조이가 악수하며 반가워하고, 철자를 묻자 루카스가 손가락으로 세며 대답하는 장면","prompt":"Zoe shakes hands with Lucas happily, then Lucas counts letters on his fingers, a sunny city park with green grass, trees and a soccer field. No text, no letters, no numbers anywhere in the picture.","file_name":"l1-2-4-3"},{"lesson":2,"pos":4,"seq":4,"lines":"9","desc_ko":"유나가 아이들을 부르고 루카스가 공을 들어 올리며 모두 축구하러 달려가는 장면","prompt":"Yuna calls Zoe and Lucas to come and play, Lucas lifts the soccer ball, the three run happily toward the field, a sunny city park with green grass, trees and a soccer field. No text, no letters, no numbers anywhere in the picture.","file_name":"l1-2-4-4"}]$j$::jsonb) as x(lesson int, pos int, seq int, lines text, desc_ko text, prompt text, file_name text)
      join flow_lessons fl on fl.unit_id = v_unit and fl.no = x.lesson
      join flow_steps s on s.lesson_id = fl.id and s.pos = x.pos and s.kind in ('scene', 'scenerep')
    on conflict (step_id, seq) do nothing;
    get diagnostics v_n = row_count; raise notice 'L1 scene prompts: % (expected 19)', v_n;
  end if;

  -- 단어 그림 프롬프트 (이미지 제작 > 단원 단어·삽화)
  insert into image_prompts(unit_id, kind, key, en, ko, prompt, seq)
  select v_unit, x.kind, x.key, x.en, x.ko, x.prompt, row_number() over ()::int from jsonb_to_recordset($j$[{"kind":"word","key":"brazil","en":"Brazil","ko":"브라질","prompt":"Show the national flag of Brazil waving on a small flagpole (the flag only, no text)."},{"kind":"word","key":"egypt","en":"Egypt","ko":"이집트","prompt":"Show the national flag of Egypt waving on a small flagpole (the flag only, no text)."},{"kind":"word","key":"france","en":"France","ko":"프랑스","prompt":"Show the national flag of France waving on a small flagpole (the flag only, no text)."},{"kind":"word","key":"korea","en":"Korea","ko":"한국","prompt":"Show the national flag of Korea waving on a small flagpole (the flag only, no text)."},{"kind":"word","key":"thailand","en":"Thailand","ko":"태국","prompt":"Show the national flag of Thailand waving on a small flagpole (the flag only, no text)."},{"kind":"word","key":"us","en":"U.S.","ko":"미국","prompt":"Show the national flag of the United States waving on a small flagpole (the flag only, no text)."}]$j$::jsonb) as x(kind text, key text, en text, ko text, prompt text)
  on conflict (unit_id, kind, key) do nothing;
  raise notice 'L1 vocab %, expressions %, scripts %, image prompts %', (select count(*) from unit_vocab where unit_id = v_unit), (select count(*) from unit_expressions where unit_id = v_unit), (select count(*) from unit_sources where unit_id = v_unit and kind = 'script'), (select count(*) from image_prompts where unit_id = v_unit);
end $do$;
